{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99327","id":2183320326,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6CItMG","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99327","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99327.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99327.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99327","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99327/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99327/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99327/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0a4dd371b7a2b8d6a832e7207906b88e9649fc08","number":99327,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement `AudioStreamSynchronized::get_bar_beats()`, fix division by zero","user":{"login":"colinator27","id":17358554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzU4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17358554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27","html_url":"https://github.com/colinator27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colinator27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/92453, and tested using its MRP. `get_bar_beats()` was unimplemented on `AudioStreamSynchronized`, so this implements it similarly to other methods like `get_bpm()`. It could also be implemented more similarly to `get_beat_count()`, which gets the maximum beat count (not just the first), although it's a bit unclear what the intended behavior would be if there are different bar beats for each sub-stream.\r\n\r\nThe underlying issue is that `get_bar_beats()` is used to calculate the end time of the current bar (in `AudioStreamInteractive`), and without an implementation, it returns zero. This leads to a division by zero, resulting in NaN, which completely breaks timings. Thus, this PR also adds a guard which will check if bar beats is > 0 (if not, the transition will instead occur immediately), since this can probably occur with other stream types that still do not implement `get_bar_beats()`.\r\n\r\n(As a side note, this division by zero guard may also need to be implemented in the new code introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99188.)","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"ht